      "message": "Maybe resetting SPI also requires redoing some of the DMA setup?\n\nAlso, should only reset SPI if chip select is high.  If it\u0027s low, you\u0027ll kill SPI just as a transfer starts...\n\nCould also be that when chip select goes high, there\u0027s still data in the FIFO that DMA hasn\u0027t finished reading out.  So might need to delay SPI reset a bit.",
